bject-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060810084345&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Dust_32d859.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  vampire dust.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Sun can be a merciless killer, but so can you.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be obtained by using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%20Wooden%20Stake\">Blessed Wooden Stake</a> on the corpses of slain Vampires. See statistics at Vampire Dust/Dusting.<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>20 of them are needed to acquire Assassin Outfits.</li>\n<li>30 of them are needed for an addon of female <a href=\"#/quest/mage-outfits-quest\">Mage Outfits Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>30 of them are needed for an addon of male <a href=\"#/quest/summoner-outfits-quest\">Summoner Outfits Quest</a>.</li>\n<li>20 of them are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This item used to be an ingredient for the <a href=\"#/quest/bewitched\">Bewitched</a> event up until it was removed from the list in 2019.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><